      "requirement_source": "issue365-current.md section 2.1/2.2; frozen baseline packages/ts-analyzer/src/javascript-diagnostics.ts:236-329",
      "mechanism": "With retained=false, inspect_subject creates semantic_fs from SDK files plus only the subject source. The frontend built from that filesystem is reused for resolved static links, and declared_external also reads from semantic_fs. A captured sibling module and repository package.json are absent from that system. javascriptObservation consequently reports unresolved for a normal relative JS import that exists in the captured ordinary input, and for an uninstalled dependency declared in package.json that baseline classifies as external.",
      "baseline_evidence": "Baseline inspectJavaScriptSource creates a source-only AST for diagnostics, but recordModuleLink calls resolveTypeScriptModule(specifier,path,undefined,true,compilerInputs,workspaceLinks,repositoryRoot), and isDeclaredExternal reads package.json via the real/retained system. These resolution inputs are distinct from the isolated semantic-dependency program.",
      "observable_examples": [
        {
          "retained": false,
          "files": {
            "/repo/use.js": "import {value} from './dep.js'; export {value};",
            "/repo/dep.js": "export const value=1;"
          },
          "baseline_static_link": {
            "specifier": "./dep.js",
            "resolution": "resolved"
          },
          "candidate_static_link_inferred_from_source": {
            "specifier": "./dep.js",
            "resolution": "unresolved"
          }
        },
        {
          "retained": false,
          "files": {
            "/repo/use.js": "import value from 'external-pkg'; export {value};",
            "/repo/package.json": "{\"dependencies\":{\"external-pkg\":\"1.0.0\"}}"
          },
          "baseline_static_link": {
            "specifier": "external-pkg",
            "resolution": "external"
          },
          "candidate_static_link_inferred_from_source": {
            "specifier": "external-pkg",
            "resolution": "unresolved"
          }
        }
      ],
      "evidence_kind": "deterministic source trace; no candidate/baseline execution or qualification query performed by reviewer",
      "requested_correction": "Resolve JavaScript links and declared-external manifests through the complete ordinary captured/workspace system while preserving the source-only semantic-dependency context. Add DEV positive cases for existing relative import and declared external package, alongside unresolved negative."
    }
